	For an image similarity test, use 256 dimensions as the default.

	EmbeddingGemma-2 supports 768, 512, 256, and 128 dimensions through Matryoshka truncation. The model guidance says quality is close to lossless at 256, while 128 can substantially degrade multimodal/image quality. Model card
	- 256D: recommended balance for product-image similarity
	- 512D: use for fine-grained differences or near-duplicate detection
	- 768D: maximum quality; use when storage/search cost is irrelevant
	- 128D: only for coarse similarity after validating recall
	Always re-normalize after truncation:


